{"id":"9683212a4006caa3","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-mu-operator-closure.md","title":"μ-Operator Closure","display":"df-mu-operator-closure — μ-Operator Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-mu-operator-closure","aliases":["68-df-mu-operator-closure"],"display":"df-mu-operator-closure — μ-Operator Closure","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§5 minimization and Proposition 5.4, p.10 / PDF 19; partial-function extension","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-mu-operator-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-mu-operator-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mu-operator-closure — μ-Operator Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5 minimization and Proposition 5.4, p.10 / PDF 19; partial-function extension"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F\\)</span> 与有限序列连接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n:\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\to\\mathcal F_n\">\\(\\mu_n:\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\to\\mathcal F_n\\)</span> 是下式定义的算子；固定元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 时保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu g\">\\(\\mu g\\)</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n(g)\">\\(\\mu_n(g)\\)</span> 的缩写。参数元组始终为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\">\\(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n(g):=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle,0)\\in g\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb N\\;(v\\ne0\\land(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle z\\rangle,v)\\in g)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_n(g):=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle,0)\\in g\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb N\\;(v\\ne0\\land(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle z\\rangle,v)\\in g)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\cap\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\;(\\mu_n(g)\\in G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\cap\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\;(\\mu_n(g)\\in G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§5.4（印刷 p.10 / PDF p.19）的 μ 搜索用于递归关系，故其矩阵为全的表示函数。此处保留目录惯用的更一般偏函数最小化，但显式要求所有较小参数已经定义且非零；两个不同输出不可能都满足该条件。它可由机器顺序计算 g(x,0),g(x,1),… 实现，遇发散即发散。因此这是有说明的保守扩展，而非把原书的关系搜索直接改写成忽略发散的集合最小值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F$ 与有限序列连接见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$F\\subseteq\\mathcal F$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}$。$\\mu_n:\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\to\\mathcal F_n$ 是下式定义的算子；固定元数 $n$ 时保留 $\\mu g$ 作为 $\\mu_n(g)$ 的缩写。参数元组始终为 $\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_n:\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\to\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_n(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_n(g):=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle,0)\\in g\\land\\forall z<y\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb N\\;(v\\ne0\\land(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle z\\rangle,v)\\in g)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\cap\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\;(\\mu_n(g)\\in G)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1878,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-mu-operator-closure]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-mu-operator-closure]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-mu-operator-closure|df-mu-operator-closure — μ-Operator Closure]]"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2"]}